---
title: "Programmable Logic Controller Systems II"
code: "ELE-234"
category: "electrical-technology"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: ETR 156 and ETR 211 or equivalent."
---

Teaches operating and programming of programmable logic controllers. Covers analog and digital interfacing and communication schemes as they apply to system. Part II of II. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 3 hours. Total 5 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
